              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bali makuhani wengi, na Walawi, na wakuu wa koo za mababa, waliokuwa wameiona nyumba ya kwanza, wakati msingi wa nyumba hii ulipowekwa mbele ya macho yao, walilia kwa sauti kuu; na watu wengi walipiga kelele za furaha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hata watu wasiweze kupambanua kelele za furaha, na kelele za vilio vya watu; maana watu walipiga kelele kwa sauti kuu, na kelele zao zikasikika mbali sana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.13",
